  "units": "millimetres",
  "coordinates": "Every mesh is expressed in the shared world/base coordinate frame at mechanical zero. Do not treat vertices as link-local coordinates.",
  "animation": "Link i is moved by the nominal ABB DH transform F_i(q) multiplied by inverse F_i(0). base_link remains fixed at identity. Upstream URDF axes, flange approximation and inertial data are not used for motion solving.",
